    "summary": "Hardened the ledger economy (owned paths only; no commit). (1) The list is now `LedgerState.requests`, replacing `purchases`: PurchaseRecord | RefusalRecord keyed by (playerId, requestId). Only insufficient-gold, tonic-limit, player-in-duel and player-disconnected are kept; they charge nothing and replay with the same state even when they would now succeed. At most 16 per player (MAX_RECORDED_REFUSALS), oldest evicted, and an evicted id is decided afresh. PurchaseResult gains `refusal`. (2) addPlayer lost its `gold` option: every purse is rules.startingGold. checkLedger asserts goldIssued = players x startingGold + sum(grants), as well as balances + goldSpent = goldIssued. (3) Grant keys are bounded: ruin = String(island) of a source's island; supply-cache must be in the new `supplyCaches` (createLedger option, validated by the new content validateSupplyCaches, stored in state). Other keys are refused as unknown-source, and checkLedger flags unknown recorded keys. (4) The property test relaxes the same-state check only for a first-time kept refusal, which may change only requests and tick (checked by hash). It uses per-player request ids, adds rebuy misuse with the same player's own id for the other item, retries refusals, and asserts that no successful useTonic had an active tonic just before. It adds EXERCISED entries. (5) New scripted tests: shared ids, refusal replay after a grant, stale/unknown/left requests not kept, 17th refusal evicts the first, unknown keys including a fresh key per call, the minting invariant, and duel choosing-window refusals for purchase and useTonic. Changed test expectations: purchase refusal test ids renamed (r4/r5 reuse would now replay); another player's same id now succeeds instead of `duplicate`; ruin keys changed from 'ruin-N' to island strings, and a ruin with key 'supply-1' is now unknown-source; the PvP-rounding test sets startingGold in rules; the addPlayer gold:-1 check now asserts that a forged purse is ignored; the corrupted-state test uses the new shapes. docs/objectives.md updated (state, idempotency, invariant, economy, rumor flow). Checks run locally after npm ci: npm run typecheck, test:unit (679 passed), test:integration (36 passed), build: all exit 0.",
